            "notes": "# Main focus this round\n-  [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) \n-  [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) \n-  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) \n\n**The main two items are [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) and [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718). With  [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) and  [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b), we will constantly be able to give our team extra health and be able to cleanse any effects.  If you have enough pick up [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56), this will increase the amount of overhealth given and help reduce the cooldown on teleport and suzo.**\n\n\n# Extra money\n**If you have extra money, your priority is getting the most ability power.  I have a few options in the optional items. Try to get the maximum amount of ability power you can afford.  This will increase the overhealth given from  [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) and increase the health given from [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b).**",
