            "notes": "# Main focus this round \n- [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) \n- [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) \n- [Talisman of Velocity](item_9b81fbe9-c5f8-4442-93d5-082b036010a1) \n- [Our Bikes](item_d9fa8542-237e-49d5-b6a1-4e910d5c777f) \n- [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) \n\n**Our last main item is [Our Bikes](item_d9fa8542-237e-49d5-b6a1-4e910d5c777f). This, paired with [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68), means we get our ultimate faster and with our high ability power, our allies will constantly be healed throughout the ultimate.  And with the suzo buffs from [Talisman of Velocity](item_9b81fbe9-c5f8-4442-93d5-082b036010a1) & [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) they're going to be full health, speedy &  shooting super fast.**\n\n# Playstyle update\n- With our ultimate, we want to make sure we use suzo while in our ult, also want to make sure you're shooting at the enemies, since you shoot super fast, it's a waste if you're not shooting at something.  This doesn't make your team invincible, so make sure to still be aware of any threats, especially towards the end of the ult.",
